@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Web Developer Checklist";
}

<div class="col-sm-12" id="doc-content">
    <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
        Below is the checklist that all web developers must follow strictly.
    </div>
    <ol class="checklist">
        <li>
            <p class="first-item">Read the requirement carefully, estimate task duration accurately and change the status of the task to a different state properly.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Build and fix any build <strong class="text-danger">errors</strong>, <strong class="text-warning">warnings</strong> reported by Visual Studio, <a href="http://dev.nexcel.vn/index.php/stylecop-make-your-code-understandable/">Stylecop</a> , <a href="http://dev.nexcel.vn/index.php/integrate-fxcop-to-your-visual-studio-2010-to-improve-code-quality/">Fxcop</a> and <a href="http://dev.nexcel.vn/index.php/a-javascript-code-quality-tool/">Jshint</a></p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Test the function on at least 3 browsers IE, Firefox and Chrome to make sure it works properly</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Run the function, check and fix any HTML/CSS errors</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Run the function and make sure that <a href="https://developer.yahoo.com/yslow/">YSLOW</a> must be grade A or above and <a href="https://developers.google.com/speed/pagespeed/insights_extensions">PageSpeed</a> must be 90+</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Run the function, use SQL Profiler to capture the SQL query and check if the column mapping is correct</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Sort and remove unused namespace usage</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Add comment to unmanaged code, magic string and magic number</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Fix invalid comment</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Remove dead code</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>Remove redundant code, reference libraries, spaces and files</p>
        </li>
    </ol>
</div>
